Source: genbu-robot
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Genbu Robot Maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/nnarain/genbu_robot

Package: genbu-robot
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd, docker-ce | docker.io, bluetooth, bluez, bluez-tools, joystick, avahi-daemon, curl
Recommends: docker-compose-plugin
Description: Systemd service to launch the Genbu robot Docker container
 Installs and manages a systemd unit that runs the Genbu robot container
 at boot. Includes dependencies for Bluetooth gamepad support.
 Runtime behavior can be configured through /etc/default/genbu-robot.
